    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classjuce_1_1JUCEApplicationBase" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::JUCEApplicationBase</ref> of the LING command line, started by START_JUCE_APPLICATION. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_application_1a2f873a3abcc4cc7b154269b80ef7c84f" kindref="member">initialise()</ref> either writes the toolchain argument and the manifest path to the model, or it sets the exit code and quits. The processor writes the documents count, and the application prints each document and quits. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
